        "name": "iPhone Duo · Home",
        "documentation": "Actual unmodified Dot Dash screenshot captured from iPhone Duo (iOS 27.1), LCD / screenID 1, on 2026-10-21. Native PNG 1398 × 2034; displayed at 3× scale in a 466 × 678 point frame. Transparent rectangles provide prototype hotspots.",
        "properties": {
          "start": true
        },
